        "TileImage": "$($repository ed4d39e0-98ce-4146-9e06-c668447485d7).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47, your destination is Marrakesh, Morocco.\r\rGeneral Reza Zaydan is planning to overthrow Morocco&apos;s government by instigating riots in the streets and imposing martial law.\r\rOur client, another Moroccan General, has tasked us with eliminating Zaydan&apos;s top Lieutenants so he can secure control of Morocco&apos;s military and prevent the coup. Additionally, these four men directed the assault on Strandberg&apos;s prison transport vehicle, resulting in the deaths of six innocent police officers.",
